    "en": {
      "trackName": "Game Box: Game Collection",
      "description": "A growing collection of classic mini games packed into one app for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch — action, puzzle and arcade challenges for every mood.\n\n■ MANY GAMES, ONE APP\nOne download, endless ways to play. From fast-paced arcade action to brain-teasing puzzles, there's always a game for your break. New games are added regularly, so there's always something fresh to discover.\n\n■ APPLE WATCH\nThe full game collection runs natively on Apple Watch — perfect for quick breaks. Compete with friends and chase new records wherever you are.\n\n■ FEATURES\n• Works completely offline — play anywhere, anytime\n• Sound effects and vibration feedback (toggle anytime in Settings)\n• Lightweight and battery-friendly\n• iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch support\n\nDownload today and relive the golden age of arcade gaming — one tap at a time!",
      "releaseNotes": "Supports iPhone and iPad.",
